  "review_notes": [
    "whether ... or is one correlative rendering of the single waw under rule 14; the two be prepositions are not what whether says, so they go unrepresented under rule 40.",
    "The supplied he of whether he be home born is added: no nominal or pronominal morpheme stands in the clause, and rule 41's supplied pronoun is reserved for an article on a participle or adjective.",
    "home born is headed on home by rule 31's subtraction test, but the tie with born is genuine."
